  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RiceTechCambodia: Adding value to the organic rice sector in Cambodia leading to inclusive growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to add value to the organic rice value chain in Cambodia.With this project intervention 2,400 small-scale rice farmers will be reached in the Mondulkiri province, from which 1,300 farmers will receive extensive training on organic agriculture and good agricultural practices. At the same time, these farmers will get access to drying, storage and milling facilities. This increases the quality of the rice products that can be sold and in this way increase the income of farmers. Also, access to the international sales market is ensured with this intervention.</narrative>
  </description>
